==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mr. Mer]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**8 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you haven't used them yet, [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N111 (Super Rare Cat)|Cop Cat]] are insanely strong here. Combine any one of them with other anti-Traitless units you haven't used yet and this stage should be fine.

